WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.090
Unit two. Disease Prevention!

2
00:00:04.057 --> 00:00:07.857
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:11.703
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.753 --> 00:00:15.826
Today we learn about Disease Prevention. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.626 --> 00:00:20.276
Bacteria. Say it with me. Bacteria!

6
00:00:23.781 --> 00:00:27.398
Virus. Say it with me. Virus!

7
00:00:30.882 --> 00:00:34.782
Infection. Say it with me. Infection!

8
00:00:38.282 --> 00:00:41.882
Antibody. Say it with me. Antibody!

9
00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:49.397
Sanitation. Say it with me. Sanitation!

10
00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:56.360
Outbreak. Say it with me. Outbreak!

11
00:00:59.843 --> 00:01:04.376
Prevention method. Say it with me. Prevention method!

12
00:01:07.875 --> 00:01:11.875
Public health. Say it with me. Public health!

13
00:01:15.376 --> 00:01:26.486
Bacteria and a virus can both cause an infection, but my body makes an antibody to fight back. Good sanitation helps prevent an outbreak. Prevention methods protect public health for everyone.

14
00:01:26.536 --> 00:01:27.728
I can do that too!

15
00:01:29.008 --> 00:01:34.289
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:34.339 --> 00:01:35.489
Infection!

17
00:01:36.526 --> 00:01:41.873
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:41.923 --> 00:01:43.498
Prevention method!

19
00:01:44.428 --> 00:01:51.022
Did you know? Not all bacteria are harmful — some bacteria in your body actually help you digest food!

20
00:01:51.072 --> 00:01:53.232
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:54.655 --> 00:02:03.219
Think and answer. What prevention methods help stop the spread of disease?

22
00:02:03.269 --> 00:02:04.419
Great answer!

23
00:02:05.518 --> 00:02:10.435
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:10.485 --> 00:02:13.125
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

